  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>मिशन समाप्त हो गया: [resolvedQuestName]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The bandit camp has packed up and moved on. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>डाकुओं के शिविर ने डेरा समेटा और आगे बढ़ गया। मिशन [resolvedQuestName] समाप्त हो गया।</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>मिशन विफल: [resolvedQuestName]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: After being discovered, the bandit camp has dispersed. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>खोजे जाने के बाद, डाकू शिविर ने अपना सामान समेटा और चला गया। मिशन [resolvedQuestName] समाप्त हो गया।</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>भुगतान आ गया है।</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have defeated the bandit camp!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>तुमने डाकुओं के शिविर को हरा दिया है!\n\nगुट की मदद करने के लिए भुगतान [asker_faction_name] आ गया है।</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelFavorReceiver.slateRef>[asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelFavorReceiver.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: These colonists participated in the victory for the quest [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextFavorReceiver.slateRef>इन उपनिवेशवादियों ने खोज के विजय में भाग लिया [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] जानना चाहता है कि किसे मिलना चाहिए [royalFavorReward_amount] का [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] इस सेवा के लिए।</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextFavorReceiver.slateRef>
  
